#. Description of the plugin
#: woo-fb-tracking-server-side.php
msgid ""
"WooCommerce plugin for Hybrid Native tracking (Meta Browser Pixel + "
"Conversions API CAPI v21.0) with Concord & Woo Gads GDPR consent and HPOS "
"compatibility."
msgstr ""
"Extension WooCommerce de suivi hybride natif (Pixel Navigateur Meta + "
"Conversions API CAPI v21.0) conforme RGPD (Concord & Woo Gads) et compatible"
" HPOS."

