msgid "1. Meta API & Pixel Settings"
msgstr "1. Paramètres Meta API & Pixel"

#: includes/class-wfbt-admin-settings.php:415
msgid "Meta Pixel ID"
msgstr "ID du Pixel Meta"

#: includes/class-wfbt-admin-settings.php:418
msgid "Your Meta Pixel ID (found in Meta Events Manager)."
msgstr ""
"Votre identifiant de Pixel Meta (accessible dans le Gestionnaire "
"d'événements Meta)."

#: includes/class-wfbt-admin-settings.php:422
msgid "Conversions API Access Token"
msgstr "Jeton d'accès Conversions API"

#: includes/class-wfbt-admin-settings.php:425
msgid ""
"System User access token generated from Meta Events Manager > Settings > "
"Conversions API."
msgstr ""
"Jeton d'accès système généré depuis Meta Events Manager > Paramètres > API "
"Conversions."

#: includes/class-wfbt-admin-settings.php:429
msgid "Test Event Code (Optional)"
msgstr "Code d'événement de test (Optionnel)"

#: includes/class-wfbt-admin-settings.php:432
msgid ""
"Enter this code to see your events in real-time in Meta Events Manager "
"\"Test events\" tab."
msgstr ""
"Renseignez ce code pour visualiser vos événements en temps réel dans "
"l'onglet « Tester les événements » de Meta."

#: includes/class-wfbt-admin-settings.php:436
msgid "Enable Browser Pixel"
msgstr "Activer le Pixel Navigateur"

#: includes/class-wfbt-admin-settings.php:440
msgid "Enable client-side tracking (fbq)"
msgstr "Activer le tracking côté client (fbq)"

#: includes/class-wfbt-admin-settings.php:442
msgid ""
"Injects fbevents.js and fires PageView, ViewContent, AddToCart (AJAX), "
"InitiateCheckout, and Purchase with eventID deduplication."
msgstr ""
"Injecte fbevents.js et déclenche PageView, ViewContent, AddToCart (AJAX), "
"InitiateCheckout et Purchase avec déduplication eventID."

#: includes/class-wfbt-admin-settings.php:446
msgid "Server-Side AddToCart (CAPI)"
msgstr "AddToCart côté serveur (CAPI)"

#: includes/class-wfbt-admin-settings.php:450
msgid "Enable server-side AddToCart tracking via Conversions API"
msgstr "Activer le suivi AddToCart côté serveur via l'API Conversions"

#: includes/class-wfbt-admin-settings.php:452
msgid ""
"Sends AddToCart events directly to Meta Conversions API via Action Scheduler"
" with the exact same eventID as the browser pixel. Ensures 100% capture of "
"cart additions, even when ad blockers (uBlock), Safari ITP, or network "
"dropouts block browser scripts."
msgstr ""
"Envoie les événements AddToCart directement à l'API Conversions Meta via "
"Action Scheduler, avec exactement le même eventID que le pixel navigateur. "
"Les ajouts au panier restent capturés même lorsque les bloqueurs de "
"publicité (uBlock), Safari ITP ou une coupure réseau bloquent les scripts du"
" navigateur."

#: includes/class-wfbt-admin-settings.php:456
msgid "Server-Side InitiateCheckout (CAPI)"
msgstr "InitiateCheckout côté serveur (CAPI)"

#: includes/class-wfbt-admin-settings.php:460
msgid "Enable server-side InitiateCheckout tracking via Conversions API"
msgstr "Activer le suivi InitiateCheckout côté serveur via l'API Conversions"

#: includes/class-wfbt-admin-settings.php:462
msgid ""
"Sends InitiateCheckout events to Meta Conversions API via Action Scheduler "
"with the exact same eventID as the browser pixel, strictly deduplicated per "
"cart content hash."
msgstr ""
"Envoie les événements InitiateCheckout à l'API Conversions Meta via Action "
"Scheduler, avec exactement le même eventID que le pixel navigateur, "
"dédupliqués strictement par empreinte du contenu du panier."

#: includes/class-wfbt-admin-settings.php:466
msgid "Front-End Debugger Bar"
msgstr "Barre de débogage front-end"

#: includes/class-wfbt-admin-settings.php:470
msgid "Enable live floating debug bar for administrators"
msgstr "Activer la barre de débogage flottante pour les administrateurs"

#: includes/class-wfbt-admin-settings.php:472
msgid ""
"Displays an expandable tracking inspector at the bottom-right of your store "
"pages when logged in as admin or store manager. Allows you to verify fbq "
"event triggers, Concord consent, and _fbp/_fbc cookies in real-time. "
"Completely invisible to regular shoppers."
msgstr ""
"Affiche un inspecteur de suivi repliable en bas à droite de la boutique "
"lorsque vous êtes connecté comme administrateur ou gestionnaire. Permet de "
"vérifier les déclenchements d'événements fbq, le consentement Concord et les"
" cookies _fbp/_fbc en temps réel. Totalement invisible pour les clients "
"normaux."

#: includes/class-wfbt-admin-settings.php:476
msgid "Catalog Content ID format"
msgstr "Format des ID de contenu catalogue"

#: includes/class-wfbt-admin-settings.php:484
msgid ""
"The content_ids sent with ViewContent, AddToCart, InitiateCheckout and "
"Purchase (Pixel + CAPI) must be strictly identical to the \"Content ID\" "
"column of your Meta catalog (Commerce Manager > Catalog > Items). Otherwise "
"Meta reports a 0% catalog match rate and catalog ads cannot work."
msgstr ""
"Les content_ids envoyés avec ViewContent, AddToCart, InitiateCheckout et "
"Purchase (Pixel + CAPI) doivent être strictement identiques à la colonne « "
"ID de contenu » de votre catalogue Meta (Gestionnaire des ventes > Catalogue"
" > Articles). Sinon, Meta affiche un taux de correspondance catalogue de 0 %"
" et les publicités catalogue ne peuvent pas fonctionner."

#: includes/class-wfbt-admin-settings.php:487
msgid ""
"Google for WooCommerce is active: if your Meta catalog is imported from "
"Google Merchant Center, its IDs probably use the \"gla_1234\" format."
msgstr ""
"Google for WooCommerce est actif : si votre catalogue Meta est importé "
"depuis Google Merchant Center, ses ID utilisent probablement le format « "
"gla_1234 »."

#: includes/class-wfbt-admin-settings.php:495
msgid "2. GDPR Compliance & Consent Management"
msgstr "2. Conformité RGPD & Gestion du Consentement"

#: includes/class-wfbt-admin-settings.php:499
msgid "Native Woo Gads Cookie Banner detected on this store."
msgstr "Bannière de cookies native Woo Gads détectée sur cette boutique."

#: includes/class-wfbt-admin-settings.php:500
msgid ""
"The cookie \"woo_gads_consent\" is automatically monitored and prioritized "
"for both front-end Meta Pixel and server-side CAPI. No additional "
"configuration needed."
msgstr ""
"Le cookie \"woo_gads_consent\" est automatiquement surveillé et priorisé "
"pour le Pixel Meta front-end et pour l'API CAPI serveur. Aucune "
"configuration supplémentaire n'est requise."

#: includes/class-wfbt-admin-settings.php:506
msgid "Condition tracking on GDPR consent"
msgstr "Asservir le tracking au consentement RGPD"

#: includes/class-wfbt-admin-settings.php:510
msgid "Require marketing consent (Woo Gads, Concord or Custom)"
msgstr "Exiger le consentement marketing (Woo Gads, Concord ou personnalisé)"

#: includes/class-wfbt-admin-settings.php:512
msgid ""
"Prevents Browser Pixel execution and safely cancels CAPI requests if "
"marketing consent is explicitly refused by the customer (strict GDPR / CNIL "
"compliance)."
msgstr ""
"Bloque l'exécution du Pixel navigateur et annule proprement les requêtes "
"CAPI si le client refuse explicitement le consentement marketing (conformité"
" RGPD / CNIL)."

#: includes/class-wfbt-admin-settings.php:516
msgid "Fallback / Custom cookie prefix"
msgstr "Préfixe de cookie de repli / personnalisé"

#: includes/class-wfbt-admin-settings.php:519
msgid ""
"Cookie prefix used by Concord or your custom cookie banner (default: "
"concord). Automatically used as fallback if native woo_gads_consent is not "
"present."
msgstr ""
"Préfixe de cookie utilisé par Concord ou votre bannière personnalisée (par "
"défaut : concord). Utilisé automatiquement en repli si le cookie natif "
"woo_gads_consent est absent."

#: includes/class-wfbt-admin-settings.php:526
msgid "3. Triggering & Order Statuses (Action Scheduler)"
msgstr "3. Déclenchement & Statuts de Commande (Action Scheduler)"

#: includes/class-wfbt-admin-settings.php:529
msgid "CAPI trigger order statuses"
msgstr "Statuts déclencheurs CAPI"

#: includes/class-wfbt-admin-settings.php:545
msgid ""
"Order statuses that trigger the asynchronous Purchase event to Meta CAPI "
